---
title: Russian Tea Cookies
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
cook time: 14-17 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@butter{1%cup}
@flour{2.5%cups}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@powdered sugar{0.5%cup}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@chopped nuts{0.75%cup}
@powdered sugar

Roll into balls and bake at 400 degrees for 14-17 minutes. Roll in powdered sugar.
